#ASSERT `s 2015(d)(2)(E) the person is exempt because employed or earning at the minimum rate for thirty hours` 29 217.49 7.25 EQUALS JUST FALSE -- 213d s 2015(d)(2)(E): weekly earnings of 217.49 and 29 hours
