#ASSERT `s 2015(d)(3) the household shall not participate while the member is on strike` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- 217a s 2015(d)(3): the household was eligible immediately before the non-exempt member went on strike; it does not lose eligibility
